# Cross-compiling libapparmor's swig perl/python language bindings fails with
# "emake failed" in libraries/libapparmor (the bindings are built during the
# core `make` under crossdev). The appliance only needs the C library +
# apparmor_parser + profiles to enforce the LSM, not the bindings — so disable
# them. (sys-apps/apparmor-utils, the aa-* tools, requires libapparmor[python]
# and is therefore dropped from packages.list.)
sys-libs/libapparmor -perl -python -doc
